#. ja: 疑似神降ろし……開始します！
#. de: Jetzt gibt es kein Zurück! Mach dich bereit!
#. fr: Le Primordial va apparaître... Bonne chance<nbsp>!
#. speaker: RYNE
msgctxt "cut_scene/052/VoiceMan_05201:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05201_000010_RYNE:1"
msgid "There's no turning back... Get ready!"
msgstr "Пути назад нет... Приготовься!"

#. ja: あれが……雷神ラムウ！？
#. de: Ist das ... Ramuh?
#. fr: Ouah... C'est lui le fameux Ramuh<nbsp>!?
#. speaker: GAIA
msgctxt "cut_scene/052/VoiceMan_05201:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05201_000020_GAIA:1"
msgid "So, this is Ramuh..."
msgstr "Так вот ты какой, Раму..."

#. ja: に、二属性の同時神降ろし……成功です……！
#. de: G-Geschafft, beide Elemente vereint beschworen<nbsp>...
#. fr: Double invocation de Primordial... (halète) réussie<nbsp>!
#. speaker: RYNE
msgctxt "cut_scene/052/VoiceMan_05201:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05201_000030_RYNE:1"
msgid "It worked! Both wind and fire have answered the call!"
msgstr "Получилось! И ветер, и огонь откликнулись!"

#. ja: ちょっとアンタ、大丈夫？
#. de: He, alles in Ordnung?
#. fr: Ryne<nbsp>! Ça va, tu tiens le coup<nbsp>!?
#. speaker: GAIA
msgctxt "cut_scene/052/VoiceMan_05201:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05201_000040_GAIA:1"
msgid "Ryne! Are you all right!?"
msgstr "Рин! Ты в порядке?!"

#. ja: なんて数の罪喰い……迎撃をお願いします！
#. de: Sünden<shy>ver<shy>tilger. Und viele. Wir müssen sie zurückschlagen!
#. fr: Ils sont si nombreux... Faites très attention à vous<nbsp>!
#. speaker: RYNE
msgctxt "cut_scene/052/VoiceMan_05201:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05201_000050_RYNE:1"
msgid "So many of them... But nothing we can't handle!"
msgstr "Их так много... Но нам они не страшны!"

#. ja: シヴァの力を……降ろします……！
#. de: Jetzt werde ich Shivas Kräfte entfesseln!
#. fr: Je suis prête à recevoir le pouvoir de Shiva<nbsp>!
#. speaker: RYNE
msgctxt "cut_scene/052/VoiceMan_05201:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05201_000060_RYNE:1"
msgid "I call...upon the power of Shiva!"
msgstr "Призываю... силу Шивы!"

#. ja: (-シヴァ-)あ、ああああああ……！！
#. de: (-Shiva-)Aaaaaa!
#. fr: (-Shiva-)Ah... Aaaaah<nbsp>!
#. speaker: RYNE
msgctxt "cut_scene/052/VoiceMan_05201:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05201_000070_RYNE:1"
msgid "Aaaaaahhh!"
msgstr "А-а-а-а-а!"

#. ja: どうみても暴走してるじゃない！<br>今すぐ倒してやらないと……！
#. de: Sie hat die Kontrolle verloren! Wir müssen sie stoppen!
#. fr: C'est en train de partir en vrille<nbsp>! Faut l'arrêter, et tout de suite<nbsp>!
#. speaker: GAIA
msgctxt "cut_scene/052/VoiceMan_05201:TEXT_VOICEMAN_05201_000080_GAIA:1"
msgid "No! She's lost control! You've got to stop her!"
msgstr "Нет! Она потеряла контроль! Останови её!"
